2. DATA: NOT covered by the MIT licence above

The football data in this repository and in the mod's releases (squads,
players, ratings, prices, kits, competition entrants, historic databases) is
NOT licensed under MIT. It comes from or is derived from third-party sources
and contributors, each with its own terms and credits, listed in the README and
in the release notes, among them: the 1984-85 database by DaniSwos, rosters sent
by players of the mod, Transfermarkt-derived squads, EA SPORTS FC-derived
ratings and portraits, and Wikipedia kits (CC BY-SA 4.0). Ask the maintainer
before reusing any data.

3. THE ORIGINAL GAME

Sensible World of Soccer 96/97 and its files, names and artwork belong to their
rights holders. This repository does not include the original game: the mod
patches a copy the player owns.
